WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.400
There was a last time you were carried to bed.

2
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:12.025
You had fallen asleep in the car, and someone lifted you out, and you kept your eyes shut so they wouldn't stop.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.000
They took off your shoes.

4
00:00:15.950 --> 00:00:17.850
They turned off the light.

5
00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:20.475
Neither of you knew.

6
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:26.225
You got too heavy, or too old, and it just never came up again.

7
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.475
No one wrote down the date.

8
00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:38.200
Somewhere in this week there is something you are doing for the last time, and you won't find out which one for years.
